<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Olsten downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Olsten downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert W. Baird &amp; Co Inc said it lowered its recommendation on Olsten Corp to moderately attractive from aggressive buy, and trimmed the 1996 earnings estimate to $1.55 per share from $1.60.</p>
<p>-- In midmorning New York Stock Exchange trade, the shares were off 4-1/2 to 22-1/8.</p>
